{"example": true, "id": "demo-b1", "author": "demo_big_a", "text": "我用 AI 一晚上做了个记账小工具，上线 11 天，付费用户 38 个。\n用的是现成模板，没写后端。\n做法在评论区。", "views": 74000, "replies": 96, "bookmarks": 540, "likes": 1400, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-02 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b1"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b2", "author": "demo_big_a", "text": "说实话，我第一个产品死得很惨：3 个月，0 个付费。\n后来我只改了一件事：先收钱，再写代码。", "views": 52000, "replies": 140, "bookmarks": 210, "likes": 900, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-03 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b2"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b3", "author": "demo_big_b", "text": "免费模板：我拿来做 10 个落地页的提示词，全放这了。\n1. 先写用户的一句话痛点\n2. 再写一个能验证的承诺\n3. 最后放一个按钮\n评论区有完整版。", "views": 61000, "replies": 40, "bookmarks": 880, "likes": 1500, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-01 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b3"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b4", "author": "demo_big_b", "text": "限时优惠！加微信领取全套课程，私信我即可。", "views": 8000, "replies": 5, "bookmarks": 3, "likes": 20, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-02 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b4"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b5", "author": "demo_big_c", "text": "做小工具最贵的不是服务器，是你每天花在没人用的功能上的时间。\n我删掉了 6 个功能，留存反而涨了。", "views": 43000, "replies": 160, "bookmarks": 150, "likes": 800, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-03 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b5"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b6", "author": "demo_big_c", "text": "卡了我三天：支付回调老是丢。\n最后发现是我自己把测试密钥放到了线上。\n你们踩过最离谱的坑是什么？", "views": 38000, "replies": 210, "bookmarks": 60, "likes": 600, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-01 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b6"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b7", "author": "demo_big_a", "text": "从 0 到第一个付费用户，我只用了 9 天。\n没投广告，只在 3 个社区回答问题。\n每天的动作我列在图里。", "views": 90000, "replies": 120, "bookmarks": 760, "likes": 2100, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-02 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b7"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b8", "author": "demo_big_b", "text": "AI 圈今天又发布了新模型，让我们拭目以待。", "views": 12000, "replies": 3, "bookmarks": 4, "likes": 40, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-03 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b8"}
{"example": true, "id": "demo-b9", "author": "demo_big_c", "text": "今天又没有人注册。\n我把落地页给 5 个陌生人看，4 个说看不懂我在卖什么。\n我重写了第一行。", "views": 27000, "replies": 90, "bookmarks": 85, "likes": 500, "reposts": 0, "created_at": "2026-11-01 08:00:00", "url": "https://example.com/demo/b9"}
